        {
          "text": "Gitoko camme kene pat, ki megi bene pat, ki pa Luejipt ma yam gicamo kwedgi bene pat kakengi, pien Luejipt pe gicamo kacel ki jo Ibru, bedo me kwer ki bot Luejipt. ",
          "type": "text",
